  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding from Alaska Medicaid Movantik Criteria Version 1; effective_date 2016-11-30. Movantik (naloxegol) tablets: 12.5 mg and 25 mg; OIC in adults with chronic non-cancer pain.",
    "PA path: encoded diagnosis, age, current opioid use, OTC constipation medication failure after at least 1 week, gastrointestinal obstruction/recurrent obstruction risk, and CYP3A4 interaction denials.",
    "Point of sale (notes only): claims auto-pay with an opioid claim dated within the past 30 days. When no such claim exists, the PA criteria apply. The 30-day opioid lookback is not an encoded bypass.",
    "Authorization (manual review): initial coverage up to 3 months; reauthorization up to an additional 6 months requires all initial criteria and documented evidence of a positive clinical response.",
    "Quantity limit (manual review): 1 tablet per day."
